sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as Writer
    participant P as Primary
    participant R as Replica
    participant Rd as Reader
    W->>P: write
    P-->>W: acknowledged
    P->>R: replicate asynchronously
    Rd->>R: read immediately after
    alt replication has caught up
        R-->>Rd: the new value
    else still lagging
        R-->>Rd: the old value
        Note over Rd,R: read-your-own-writes broken — route that user to the primary
    end
    Note over P,R: sync replication protects the data and costs latency — async does the reverse
